---
/**
 * "The chemistry of beauty" — the same editorial explainer as CloseContactChemistry.astro
 * (Close Contact), written for this product. Deliberately conservative: no ingredient names and no
 * physiological or cosmetic claims while the formula is unfinalized. Every paragraph carries
 * data-copy-review, so `pnpm check:placeholders` lists it until it is approved.
 */
import Brand from "@/components/ui/Brand.astro";
const h3 = "text-[26px] leading-[1.05] font-black uppercase";
const body = "mt-2 text-xl leading-[1.6]";
const block = "border-t-2 border-dashed border-green pt-[clamp(24px,3vw,40px)]";
---

<section id="chemistry-of-beauty" class="section-px section-py bg-pink">
  <div class="container-lg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
      <p class="label-caps flex items-center gap-3 text-[17px] text-green">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2.5 flex-none animate-[sg-blink_1.6s_ease-in-out_infinite] rounded-full bg-green"></span>
        The chemistry of beauty
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-word stretch-display mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[0.88]">Beauty is chemistry, too.</h2>

      <div class="mt-[clamp(28px,3vw,44px)] grid gap-[clamp(20px,3vw,32px)]">
        <p class="text-xl leading-[1.6]" data-copy-review="Beauty copy: no cosmetic claims while the formula is pending (intro)">
          Hair, skin and nails are built from what your body has to work with every day. <strong><Brand /> Beauty is designed to fit into your everyday routine</strong> — nutrition from within, not another product to layer on.
        </p>

        <div class:list={[block]}>
          <h3 class:list={[h3]}>Your routine is the whole story.</h3>
          <p class:list={[body]} data-copy-review="Beauty copy: no cosmetic claims while the formula is pending (block 1)">
            Food, hydration, sleep and everything you put on your skin all play a part. <strong>No gummy replaces any of them</strong> — Beauty is meant to sit alongside them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class:list={[block]}>
          <h3 class:list={[h3]}>That's where Beauty comes in.</h3>
          <p class:list={[body]} data-copy-review="Beauty copy: no cosmetic claims while the formula is pending (block 2)">
            A chewable dietary supplement for hair, skin and nail nutrition, with a liquid center and a flavor you look forward to. The formula is still being finalized — we will share exactly what is in it once it is locked in.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class:list={[block]}>
          <p class="text-xl leading-[1.6]" data-copy-review="Beauty copy: no cosmetic claims while the formula is pending (close)">
            It doesn't replace a balanced diet, water, sunscreen or the routine you already love. <strong>It's the little extra</strong> — for the days when "I'll take care of myself properly tomorrow" has become a lifestyle.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
